# Caddy edge proxy — secrets.
# Copy to caddy/.env (gitignored) on the deploy operator's machine and
# fill in the real value. yeet.sh scp's the caddy/ directory to the
# host; docker-compose.yaml loads this file via env_file: on the caddy
# service, so its values are injected into the Caddy container's
# environment at runtime. Never commit caddy/.env.

# Scoped Cloudflare API token used by the caddy-dns/cloudflare plugin to
# solve the ACME DNS-01 challenge for the wildcard *.fanout.run cert and
# the per-host certs. Required scope:
#   - Zone.Zone:Read   on labstack.com + fanout.run
#   - Zone.DNS:Edit    on labstack.com + fanout.run
# Create at https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens (API Tokens,
# NOT Global API Key).
CF_API_TOKEN=
